url: "https://github.com/structural-explainability/se-pilot-identity-preservation-supply-chain-software"
license: MIT

abstract: >
  Research software for testing source-grounded identity-preservation
  commitments across software supply-chain representations. The initial
  feasibility pilot evaluates whether Package URL identity information is
  preserved across SPDX and CycloneDX transformations using typed commitments,
  representation-specific adapters, explicit limitation and refusal outcomes,
  and finite conformance evidence.

